    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29836" root="عقب" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَقْبَةُ القَمَر</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِقْبَةُ القَمَرِ</span>, q. v. (L.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَقْبَةٌ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِقْبَةٌ</span></b>  signify <i>Variegated,</i> or <i>figured,
cloth:</i> (TA:) or <i>one of the sorts of variegated,</i> or
<i>figured, cloths</i> [<i>that serve for the covering</i>] <i>of the</i>
[<i>women's camel-vehicle called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَوْدَج</span>: (O, K, TA:)
as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَقْمَةٌ</span>: (O, TA:) accord. to Yaakoob, the
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ب</span> is a substitute for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">م</span>. (TA.)

